{
  "about": "Contract C19 (sub-processes): the maps a project holds and what each one is drawn from. Pinned for both sides: the viewer (viewer/sub-process-maps.js mapTree, which feeds the Steps breadcrumb, the Map picker and the live map at each level) and the pipeline (normalization/sub_process_maps.py map_tree, which feeds the step BPMN planes and the PDD chapters). A fixture step is named by its map node, as in shared/flow-links-golden.json; a link names a step of the same sub_steps list (or of the same transaction at the main level), or end. A step is a sub-process when it carries sub_steps, even an empty list. The main map (path []) is drawn from one trace per transaction: its visible steps in order. A level below is reached through visits: consecutive visible steps with one node are one visit, and a visit of a sub-process node gives one trace, the visible sub_steps of its steps in order (a visit whose steps carry no sub_steps gives none, and an empty trace is left out, so a sub-process with no visible sub-steps has a map with no traces). The map of a sub-process node at path P is drawn from the traces of every visit of that node at level P, in transaction order; its path is P plus the node. Its edges follow contract C17 on those traces, so an end inside a sub-process ends the sub-process only. A hidden step is left out with everything under it. number: the position of the node's first visit among the visible steps of the reference transaction's first trace at that level (steps are counted, not visits), after the parent's number and a dot; null when the node is not in that trace, and a map without a number gets no PDD chapter. Maps are listed depth first; at each level the sub-process nodes come in the order they first appear, the reference transaction's traces first, then the others in transaction order. reference is the index of the reference transaction (default 0).",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "no step is a sub-process: one map",
      "transactions": [
        [{"name": "A"}, {"name": "B"}, {"name": "C"}]
      ],
      "expected_maps": [
        {"path": [], "number": null, "traces": [["A", "B", "C"]], "edges": [
          {"from": "start", "to": "A", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "A", "to": "B", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "B", "to": "C", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "C", "to": "end", "label": null, "observed": true}
        ]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "a step opened in two transactions: its map is drawn from both",
      "transactions": [
        [{"name": "A"}, {"name": "B", "sub_steps": [{"name": "b1"}, {"name": "b2"}, {"name": "b3"}]}, {"name": "C"}],
        [{"name": "A"}, {"name": "B", "sub_steps": [{"name": "b1"}, {"name": "b3"}]}, {"name": "C"}]
      ],
      "expected_maps": [
        {"path": [], "number": null, "traces": [["A", "B", "C"], ["A", "B", "C"]], "edges": [
          {"from": "start", "to": "A", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "A", "to": "B", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "B", "to": "C", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "C", "to": "end", "label": null, "observed": true}
        ]},
        {"path": ["B"], "number": "2", "traces": [["b1", "b2", "b3"], ["b1", "b3"]], "edges": [
          {"from": "start", "to": "b1", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "b1", "to": "b2", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "b2", "to": "b3", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "b1", "to": "b3", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "b3", "to": "end", "label": null, "observed": true}
        ]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "a sub-process only in another transaction has no number",
      "transactions": [
        [{"name": "A"}, {"name": "C"}],
        [{"name": "A"}, {"name": "B", "sub_steps": [{"name": "x"}]}, {"name": "C"}]
      ],
      "expected_maps": [
        {"path": [], "number": null, "traces": [["A", "C"], ["A", "B", "C"]], "edges": [
          {"from": "start", "to": "A", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "A", "to": "C", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "A", "to": "B", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "B", "to": "C", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "C", "to": "end", "label": null, "observed": true}
        ]},
        {"path": ["B"], "number": null, "traces": [["x"]], "edges": [
          {"from": "start", "to": "x", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "x", "to": "end", "label": null, "observed": true}
        ]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "sub-processes nest and are numbered through the reference transaction",
      "transactions": [
        [{"name": "A", "sub_steps": [{"name": "a1", "sub_steps": [{"name": "q1"}, {"name": "q2"}]}, {"name": "a2"}]}, {"name": "B"}]
      ],
      "expected_maps": [
        {"path": [], "number": null, "traces": [["A", "B"]], "edges": [
          {"from": "start", "to": "A", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "A", "to": "B", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "B", "to": "end", "label": null, "observed": true}
        ]},
        {"path": ["A"], "number": "1", "traces": [["a1", "a2"]], "edges": [
          {"from": "start", "to": "a1", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "a1", "to": "a2", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "a2", "to": "end", "label": null, "observed": true}
        ]},
        {"path": ["A", "a1"], "number": "1.1", "traces": [["q1", "q2"]], "edges": [
          {"from": "start", "to": "q1", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "q1", "to": "q2", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "q2", "to": "end", "label": null, "observed": true}
        ]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "a hidden sub-process has no map, a hidden sub-step is not drawn, numbers count visible steps",
      "transactions": [
        [
          {"name": "A"},
          {"name": "B", "state": "hidden", "sub_steps": [{"name": "b1"}]},
          {"name": "C", "sub_steps": [{"name": "c1"}, {"name": "c2", "state": "hidden"}, {"name": "c3"}]}
        ]
      ],
      "expected_maps": [
        {"path": [], "number": null, "traces": [["A", "C"]], "edges": [
          {"from": "start", "to": "A", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "A", "to": "C", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "C", "to": "end", "label": null, "observed": true}
        ]},
        {"path": ["C"], "number": "2", "traces": [["c1", "c3"]], "edges": [
          {"from": "start", "to": "c1", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "c1", "to": "c3", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "c3", "to": "end", "label": null, "observed": true}
        ]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "two visits of one sub-process in a transaction are two traces, and the first visit numbers it",
      "transactions": [
        [{"name": "A"}, {"name": "B", "sub_steps": [{"name": "b1"}]}, {"name": "C"}, {"name": "B", "sub_steps": [{"name": "b2"}]}]
      ],
      "expected_maps": [
        {"path": [], "number": null, "traces": [["A", "B", "C", "B"]], "edges": [
          {"from": "start", "to": "A", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "A", "to": "B", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "B", "to": "C", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "C", "to": "B", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "B", "to": "end", "label": null, "observed": true}
        ]},
        {"path": ["B"], "number": "2", "traces": [["b1"], ["b2"]], "edges": [
          {"from": "start", "to": "b1", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "b1", "to": "end", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "start", "to": "b2", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "b2", "to": "end", "label": null, "observed": true}
        ]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "consecutive steps with one node are one visit, so their sub-steps are one trace",
      "transactions": [
        [{"name": "A"}, {"name": "B", "sub_steps": [{"name": "b1"}]}, {"name": "B", "sub_steps": [{"name": "b2"}]}, {"name": "C"}]
      ],
      "expected_maps": [
        {"path": [], "number": null, "traces": [["A", "B", "B", "C"]], "edges": [
          {"from": "start", "to": "A", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "A", "to": "B", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "B", "to": "C", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "C", "to": "end", "label": null, "observed": true}
        ]},
        {"path": ["B"], "number": "2", "traces": [["b1", "b2"]], "edges": [
          {"from": "start", "to": "b1", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "b1", "to": "b2", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "b2", "to": "end", "label": null, "observed": true}
        ]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "a visit without sub-steps adds no trace",
      "transactions": [
        [{"name": "A"}, {"name": "B", "sub_steps": [{"name": "b1"}, {"name": "b2"}]}, {"name": "C"}],
        [{"name": "A"}, {"name": "B"}, {"name": "C"}]
      ],
      "expected_maps": [
        {"path": [], "number": null, "traces": [["A", "B", "C"], ["A", "B", "C"]], "edges": [
          {"from": "start", "to": "A", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "A", "to": "B", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "B", "to": "C", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "C", "to": "end", "label": null, "observed": true}
        ]},
        {"path": ["B"], "number": "2", "traces": [["b1", "b2"]], "edges": [
          {"from": "start", "to": "b1", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "b1", "to": "b2", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "b2", "to": "end", "label": null, "observed": true}
        ]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "the flow inside a sub-process stays in its level: an end there ends the sub-process only",
      "transactions": [
        [
          {"name": "A"},
          {"name": "B", "sub_steps": [
            {"name": "b1", "links": [{"to": "end", "when": "cancelled"}]},
            {"name": "b2", "only_when": "new product"},
            {"name": "b3", "links": [{"to": "b1", "when": "missing price"}]},
            {"name": "b4"}
          ]},
          {"name": "C"}
        ]
      ],
      "expected_maps": [
        {"path": [], "number": null, "traces": [["A", "B", "C"]], "edges": [
          {"from": "start", "to": "A", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "A", "to": "B", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "B", "to": "C", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "C", "to": "end", "label": null, "observed": true}
        ]},
        {"path": ["B"], "number": "2", "traces": [["b1", "b2", "b3", "b4"]], "edges": [
          {"from": "start", "to": "b1", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "b1", "to": "b2", "label": "new product", "observed": true},
          {"from": "b1", "to": "b3", "label": "otherwise", "observed": false},
          {"from": "b1", "to": "end", "label": "cancelled", "observed": false},
          {"from": "b2", "to": "b3", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "b3", "to": "b4", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "b3", "to": "b1", "label": "missing price", "observed": false},
          {"from": "b4", "to": "end", "label": null, "observed": true}
        ]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "an empty sub-process has a map with no traces",
      "transactions": [
        [{"name": "A"}, {"name": "B", "sub_steps": []}, {"name": "C"}]
      ],
      "expected_maps": [
        {"path": [], "number": null, "traces": [["A", "B", "C"]], "edges": [
          {"from": "start", "to": "A", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "A", "to": "B", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "B", "to": "C", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "C", "to": "end", "label": null, "observed": true}
        ]},
        {"path": ["B"], "number": "2", "traces": [], "edges": []}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "maps are listed depth first, the reference transaction's steps first, and the reference need not be the first transaction",
      "reference": 1,
      "transactions": [
        [{"name": "C", "sub_steps": [{"name": "c1"}]}, {"name": "A", "sub_steps": [{"name": "a1"}]}],
        [{"name": "A", "sub_steps": [{"name": "a2"}]}, {"name": "B", "sub_steps": [{"name": "b1", "sub_steps": [{"name": "z"}]}]}]
      ],
      "expected_maps": [
        {"path": [], "number": null, "traces": [["C", "A"], ["A", "B"]], "edges": [
          {"from": "start", "to": "C", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "C", "to": "A", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "A", "to": "end", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "start", "to": "A", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "A", "to": "B", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "B", "to": "end", "label": null, "observed": true}
        ]},
        {"path": ["A"], "number": "1", "traces": [["a1"], ["a2"]], "edges": [
          {"from": "start", "to": "a1", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "a1", "to": "end", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "start", "to": "a2", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "a2", "to": "end", "label": null, "observed": true}
        ]},
        {"path": ["B"], "number": "2", "traces": [["b1"]], "edges": [
          {"from": "start", "to": "b1", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "b1", "to": "end", "label": null, "observed": true}
        ]},
        {"path": ["B", "b1"], "number": "2.1", "traces": [["z"]], "edges": [
          {"from": "start", "to": "z", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "z", "to": "end", "label": null, "observed": true}
        ]},
        {"path": ["C"], "number": null, "traces": [["c1"]], "edges": [
          {"from": "start", "to": "c1", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "c1", "to": "end", "label": null, "observed": true}
        ]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "a nested sub-process only in a later visit of its parent has no number",
      "transactions": [
        [{"name": "A", "sub_steps": [{"name": "a1"}]}, {"name": "B"}, {"name": "A", "sub_steps": [{"name": "a2", "sub_steps": [{"name": "z"}]}]}]
      ],
      "expected_maps": [
        {"path": [], "number": null, "traces": [["A", "B", "A"]], "edges": [
          {"from": "start", "to": "A", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "A", "to": "B", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "B", "to": "A", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "A", "to": "end", "label": null, "observed": true}
        ]},
        {"path": ["A"], "number": "1", "traces": [["a1"], ["a2"]], "edges": [
          {"from": "start", "to": "a1", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "a1", "to": "end", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "start", "to": "a2", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "a2", "to": "end", "label": null, "observed": true}
        ]},
        {"path": ["A", "a2"], "number": null, "traces": [["z"]], "edges": [
          {"from": "start", "to": "z", "label": null, "observed": true},
          {"from": "z", "to": "end", "label": null, "observed": true}
        ]}
      ]
